    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's what everyone says. \"just one small thing.\" but there is no \"one small thing.\" the shame is too loud. it's not like i'm just sad, it's like the person i was is actually dead. how do you build anything when the foundation is just... gone? it feels like there's no point in even trying to pretend anymore.",
